slations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Troppo grande per le favole","overview":"Waldek Banas è un ragazzino viziato amante dei videogiochi che vuole partecipare ad un torneo. Tuttavia, la malattia della madre e una zia eccentrica lo costringono a revisionare le sue priorità."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Too Old for Fairy Tales","overview":"In Waldek's life, filled mainly with computer games, there is a real earthquake. During her absence, mum stays under the care of a crazy and unpredictable aunt, who introduces discipline that has been alien to him so far and imposes new duties. But although an extraordinary relative gives Waldek a real survival camp, the boy also receives the most valuable life lesson from her."},{"language":"pl-PL","overview":"Historia 10-letniego Waldka, który wyrywa się spod skrzydeł kochającej mamy. Teresa, borykając się z własnymi problemami, przelewa je na chłopca i nie pozwala mu na spokojne dorastanie. Waldek chce startować w największym w Europie turnieju gamingowym. Wydaje się, że choroba mamy i ekscentryczna ciotka staną na drodze do spełnienia marzeń. Nieoczekiwanie to właśnie dzięki nim chłopiec zyska coś więcej niż wygraną w turnieju."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/er31inZjWtqTrxQyAjW0FHXVblr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRnbubdWl5M6V3YnHpPWD8HAzUE.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":939475,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"pl-PL","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mwT58VqFZyAeQbscfynxtroqaft.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mwT58VqFZyAeQbscfynxtroqaft.jpg","language":"en","width":1365,"height":2048},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mwT58VqFZyAeQbscfynxtroqaft.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb